
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Continuação CSS</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <h1>Box Model</h1>
    <h2>CSS</h2>
    <h3>HTML</h3>
    <a href="https://www.google.com/?hl=pt_BR">link</a>
    <p><span>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Reiciendis tempore doloremque sit aliquam
            necessitatibus molestiae commodi odio iste corrupti, explicabo corporis error aspernatur, est sapiente
            impedit alias quaerat, deserunt velit?</span></p>
